        {
          "id": 742401853,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "My company provided Windows 11 Enterprise lists for `HKLM:\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion`:\n| Value | Contents |\n| ------ | ------ |\n| ProductName | Windows 10 Enterprise |\n| DisplayVersion | 21H2 |\n| ReleaseId | 2009 |\n\ndwBuildNumber is 22000\n\n=> ProductName is not reliable.\nI will prepare a MR using dwBuildNumber and the Wikipedia list.",
